1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
How does ManiTaskGen index receptacles? Two tables. Three objects. Where will the serving board fit?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Focus on the empty white table.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Use the empty surface itself as the anchor. Its heading orients a three-by-three grid.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Query the center receptacle on the white table.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Return to the room and locate the occupied light wood table.

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:56,500
Index an occupied surface. Use the objects on the surface as anchors to index receptacles.

7
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:03,000
The two desk lamps become line drawings.

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Take the convex hull of each footprint and extrude it to the height of the lamp.

9
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Anchor A extends a placement region from each of its four sides and four corners.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,500
Keep the front-right region of A.

11
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:36,000
Repeat the eight directional lookups for B using the same table heading.

12
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Keep the front-left region of B.

13
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,000
The hatching marks the overlap between the two indexed regions.

14
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Trace the outside boundary of their union.

15
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Return to the room.

16
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Expand the scene graph and choose an available object.

17
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,400
Match the tea tin to the center region.

18
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:21,000
Place the tea tin in the center of the white table.

19
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:26,400
A single region indexed from A can contain the notebook.

20
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:32,000
Place the field notebook in the rear region of A.

21
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:37,900
A’s front-right region is too short for the serving board.

22
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:42,000
B’s front-left region is also too short.

23
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,700
Join the two regions and test the full board footprint.

24
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:53,000
Place the serving board in front of lamp A.

25
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:56,000
How does ManiTaskGen index receptacles?

